@{
    var resourcePath = "~/Views/MemberRequests/Guidelines/zh-tw/Super/Styles/";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=0.7, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>Play For Fun</title>
    <link type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Views/MemberRequests/Guidelines/Style/page.css")" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="feature-desc">
            <span>會員網的<span class="bold">“免費試玩”</span>是允許客人在要求開啟新產品之前以虛擬貨幣試玩。為了支持用戶管理統計信息和產品申請，已創建了名為 “免費試玩”的新功能，它提供待處理要求的總計以及啟用它們的快速方式。</span>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-images">
            <figure>
                <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f9.png")" alt="Fig 1">
                <figcaption>圖1. “免費試玩”儀表板</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-list">
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-title">總代理免費試玩資料報告</div>

                <div class="feature-desc">點擊產品名稱（或是點擊在報告欄目的免費試玩資料）查看已嘗試免費試玩的會員資料 </div>

                <div class="feature-images">
                    <figure>
                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f10.png")" alt="Fig 2">
                        <figcaption>圖2. 在主頁的免費試玩頁面</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">免費試玩報表打開如下</div>

                <div class="feature-images">
                    <figure>
                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f12.png")" alt="Fig 3">
                        <figcaption>圖3. 總代理免費試玩資料報告 </figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">請註意，報告僅根據虛擬貨幣總結了會員所選產品的統計信息。點擊帳戶名稱以獲取下線的數據細節</div>

                <ul class="level-1">
                    <li><span class="bold">玩家人數</span>: 已嘗試免費試玩產品的玩家人數</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">投注額</span>: 會員總投注額</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">會員輸贏</span>: 會員總輸贏</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">投注統計</span>: 總投注注單</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>